<title>GREECE: Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, July 28.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek central bank fixing rates, July 28.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:     July 28     July 25   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  288.400     286.600     247.020   16.75 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  308.710     309.300     306.830    0.61 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.145     156.280     158.970   -1.78 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.342	46.366	47.182   -1.78 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  476.360     477.400     419.180   13.64 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.715     138.750     141.685   -2.10 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.072	16.061	16.185   -0.70 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  245.960     246.700     212.430   15.78 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.854	 1.854	 1.888   -1.80 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.549	 1.546	 1.581   -2.02 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  189.680     189.290     183.135    3.57 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
